  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    emotion: 2
    text: "\u2026So she was never here. I knew that\u2026 didn\u2019t I?\r"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    emotion: 2
    text: " I didn\u2019t want to be the one to say goodbye. I thought if I came
      here\u2026 If I played it right\u2026 I could fix everyting. "
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    emotion: 2
    text: "But there was nothing to fix\u2026  Only to face I was clinging to a fantasy."
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7ce02c1f8c657064e91da607aebe315a, type: 2}
    emotion: 2
    text: So what do I do now?
